<title>USA: Defiance Inc says sees Q4 beating year ago.</title>
<headline>Defiance Inc says sees Q4 beating year ago.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defiance Inc said Wednesday it believes its earnings in its fourth fiscal quarter can exceed the $0.23 per share mark posted in the fourth quarter last year.</p>
<p>The company said this projection is based on the assumption that new testing and tooling programs are released as expected.</p>
</text>
